 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? They' usually looking for sweet liquid, so keep drinks in bottles and don't leave food out. A thin layer of vinegar on food helps too. Keep the food in a cool spot and lift the blankets every morning. They can't fly into a dark corner. It deters the active ones, but they' just move on. Get it off as fast as you can, and wash your clothes in hot water. Some species carry disease, so it' not silly.",
